1014
00:48:22.035 --> 00:48:23.034
(Main lead) Teacher

1015
00:48:23.935 --> 00:48:26.434
A lot of patients are looking for Yeommiso’s single room.

1016
00:48:26.501 --> 00:48:27.934
It's past dressing time

1017
00:48:28.001 --> 00:48:28.939
Me?

1018
00:48:30.010 --> 00:48:30.941
[sigh]

1019
00:48:31.433 --> 00:48:32.834
Can’t I go to another teacher?

1020
00:48:32.901 --> 00:48:35.400
(Juyeon) Ah, yesterday too
The intern teacher came

1021
00:48:35.467 --> 00:48:36.881
You were very angry.

1022
00:48:37.417 --> 00:48:39.783
He said he would definitely get it from the teacher.

1023
00:48:39.850 --> 00:48:40.868
What should I do?

1024
00:48:40.935 --> 00:48:41.952
[sigh]

1025
00:48:44.200 --> 00:48:45.064
[Nanjing’s light sigh]

1026
00:48:48.434 --> 00:48:49.963
Don't press it

1027
00:48:50.030 --> 00:48:52.365
(Smile) Please make it as painless as possible.
[humorous music]

1028
00:48:52.432 --> 00:48:53.364
(Nanjing) Yes

1029
00:49:00.480 --> 00:49:04.075
Well, I made a mistake yesterday...

1030
00:49:08.382 --> 00:49:09.380
sorry

1031
00:49:10.168 --> 00:49:12.100
In the future, another teacher will come...

1032
00:49:12.167 --> 00:49:13.434
no

1033
00:49:13.501 --> 00:49:15.219
Teacher, please keep doing it.

1034
00:49:15.719 --> 00:49:17.788
- (Nanjing) Yes?
- (Smile) 4 times a day like now

1035
00:49:18.968 --> 00:49:20.100
If you can't do it

1036
00:49:20.167 --> 00:49:21.834
I'll tell the professor

1037
00:49:21.901 --> 00:49:23.127
(Nanjing) Uh, no, no.

1038
00:49:23.694 --> 00:49:24.929
I will come

1039
00:49:26.464 --> 00:49:27.431
[Nankyung’s awkward laughter]

1040
00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:31.569
[Crying sound]

1041
00:49:35.801 --> 00:49:36.768
[Sabi’s crying sound]

1042
00:49:36.835 --> 00:49:38.376
(Sabi) Professor Gong Gong-seon

1043
00:49:39.297 --> 00:49:42.842
I scream and tell them to get out

1044
00:49:43.640 --> 00:49:45.667
Professor Seo Jeong-min

1045
00:49:45.734 --> 00:49:47.685
don't even look at me

1046
00:49:48.634 --> 00:49:49.653
me

1047
00:49:50.390 --> 00:49:52.456
I don't think I can be a doctor

1048
00:49:53.493 --> 00:49:55.459
[cell phone ringing sound]

1049
00:50:05.305 --> 00:50:06.774
What should I do if I don’t receive it?

1050
00:50:08.202 --> 00:50:10.501
I'm fine, go now

1051
00:50:10.568 --> 00:50:11.542
no

1052
00:50:12.101 --> 00:50:13.344
I did everything I was told, but

1053
00:50:15.125 --> 00:50:16.180
(Lee Young) And anyway

1054
00:50:18.202 --> 00:50:19.400
I'm going

1055
00:50:19.467 --> 00:50:21.352
(Sabi) Oh, are you going?

1056
00:50:22.135 --> 00:50:24.054
Ward? Operating room?

1057
00:50:28.203 --> 00:50:29.126
somewhere else

1058
00:50:29.897 --> 00:50:32.231
[Sound of approaching footsteps]

1059
00:50:32.866 --> 00:50:34.165
- (Sabi) Hello?
- (Dowon) Yes

1060
00:50:35.034 --> 00:50:36.200
- (Lee Young) Hello
- (Dowon) They were both here.

1061
00:50:36.267 --> 00:50:37.600
I was already trying to call you

1062
00:50:37.667 --> 00:50:39.706
Sabi, I heard Eunmi was waiting for you at the restaurant?

1063
00:50:39.773 --> 00:50:40.609
(Sabi) Oh, that’s right

1064
00:50:41.334 --> 00:50:42.940
- Let's go.
- (Dowon) Enjoy your meal

1065
00:50:45.279 --> 00:50:46.367
And Teacher Oh I-young

1066
00:50:46.434 --> 00:50:48.545
Me? Why, what
Did I do everything I asked?

1067
00:50:48.612 --> 00:50:50.617
Yeah, so I wanted to ask you something.

1068
00:50:50.684 --> 00:50:52.983
(Dowon) Well, in 10 minutes
Look in front of the emergency room

1069
00:50:57.124 --> 00:50:58.111
[sigh]

1070
00:50:58.935 --> 00:51:00.467
(Dowon) I contacted everyone in Songdo.

1071
00:51:00.534 --> 00:51:01.892
- (Lee Young) Am I going alone?
- (Dowon) Oh

1072
00:51:03.794 --> 00:51:06.363
What if the baby suddenly comes out on the way?

1073
00:51:06.430 --> 00:51:08.133
Clamp the cord with a clip and

1074
00:51:08.200 --> 00:51:09.533
Just cut it with sterile scissors.

1075
00:51:10.068 --> 00:51:13.404
While I was on my way, Teacher Oh I-young
I'm your doctor and surgeon, okay?

1076
00:51:16.901 --> 00:51:19.173
[Humorous sound effects]

1077
00:51:20.861 --> 00:51:22.467
I'm not fooled, ah...

1078
00:51:22.534 --> 00:51:24.034
I'm also quick-witted

1079
00:51:24.101 --> 00:51:26.201
(Lee Young) If it’s that dangerous
Would you like to spend a year?

1080
00:51:26.268 --> 00:51:27.384
So

1081
00:51:28.668 --> 00:51:30.287
(Do-won) Because I checked the mother’s condition.

1082
00:51:30.354 --> 00:51:31.868
Don't be too nervous and go

1083
00:51:31.935 --> 00:51:33.057
Nothing bad will happen along the way.

1084
00:51:33.891 --> 00:51:36.060
Refresh yourself while you're here.
[cell phone ringing sound]

1085
00:51:39.833 --> 00:51:40.831
See you later

1086
00:51:42.168 --> 00:51:44.201
Uh, uh, I'm leaving now.

1087
00:51:45.167 --> 00:51:46.804
[bird chirping]

1088
00:51:51.308 --> 00:51:52.601
[Lee Young sighs]

1089
00:51:52.668 --> 00:51:55.012
(Lee Young) The weather is perfect for splashing around.

1090
00:51:58.282 --> 00:51:59.783
- (Lee Young) Hello?
- (Sooyoung) Hello?

1091
00:51:59.850 --> 00:52:01.652
Teacher, how long will it take us?

1092
00:52:01.719 --> 00:52:03.089
I think it will take about an hour

1093
00:52:03.156 --> 00:52:04.524
(Swimming) Ah...

1094
00:52:04.591 --> 00:52:05.634
Ah, yes

1095
00:52:05.701 --> 00:52:07.559
Well, if you have any inconveniences

1096
00:52:07.626 --> 00:52:08.734
Please tell me right away

1097
00:52:08.801 --> 00:52:10.194
Ah, yes, sir.

1098
00:52:16.436 --> 00:52:17.902
[cell phone vibrating sound]

1099
00:52:21.033 --> 00:52:22.235
(Namkyung) Yes, teacher.

1100
00:52:22.302 --> 00:52:25.701
(Dahye) Oh, let’s eat, right?
I'm sorry, but can you come in 10 minutes?

1101
00:52:25.768 --> 00:52:27.811
(Nanjing) Yes, yes, I will go now.

1102
00:52:28.401 --> 00:52:29.280
[Call end sound]

1103
00:52:43.230 --> 00:52:44.228
[Nankyung groans in frustration]

1104
00:52:48.769 --> 00:52:50.068
(Hye-seon) Right?

1105
00:52:50.135 --> 00:52:51.368
It’s Nanjing, right?

1106
00:52:52.302 --> 00:52:54.040
- (Namkyung) Huh?
- (Hye-seon) That’s right!

1107
00:52:54.107 --> 00:52:55.694
Have you been here at the hospital?

1108
00:52:55.761 --> 00:52:58.068
Oh, that's right, that's right, Jongno Yulje

1109
00:52:58.135 --> 00:53:00.614
Hey, you were eating.
Eat it quickly, eat it quickly

1110
00:53:00.681 --> 00:53:02.767
(Namkyung) Huh? no, no
I ate it all, I ate it all

1111
00:53:02.834 --> 00:53:04.634
Hyeseon, what are you doing here?

1112
00:53:04.701 --> 00:53:05.534
Why in the hospital?

1113
00:53:05.601 --> 00:53:07.684
(Hye-seon) Ah, here is the director of the health check-up center.

1114
00:53:07.751 --> 00:53:10.601
Because my father-in-law is a friend
To get a checkup before marriage

1115
00:53:10.668 --> 00:53:13.156
(Namkyung) Oh, you said you were married, right?

1116
00:53:13.223 --> 00:53:14.934
You must come to the wedding

1117
00:53:15.001 --> 00:53:15.996
Okay?

1118
00:53:16.063 --> 00:53:17.428
Yeah, I'll go.

1119
00:53:18.796 --> 00:53:22.034
Hey, but I almost didn't recognize you.

1120
00:53:22.101 --> 00:53:23.434
(Hye-seon) I feel like a different person

1121
00:53:24.634 --> 00:53:25.934
I'm a little busy

1122
00:53:26.001 --> 00:53:26.937
(Hye-sun) Yes...

1123
00:53:28.101 --> 00:53:29.139
Wait a minute

1124
00:53:32.202 --> 00:53:33.801
Hey, I'm up.

1125
00:53:33.868 --> 00:53:35.068
I'll go first

1126
00:53:35.135 --> 00:53:36.450
- Finish eating.
- (Namkyung) Huh?

1127
00:53:36.517 --> 00:53:38.345
Uh, okay, go.

1128
00:53:52.202 --> 00:53:53.434
[cell phone vibrating sound]

1129
00:53:59.706 --> 00:54:00.901
yes

1130
00:54:00.968 --> 00:54:02.309
(Juyeon) Teacher Yeom Miso is a patient.

1131
00:54:02.376 --> 00:54:04.734
It seems like there's more ooze coming out.
Please complain

1132
00:54:04.801 --> 00:54:06.677
Why don't you give me painkillers?

1133
00:54:06.744 --> 00:54:08.979
Also the heart
They say it feels like I'm running fast.

1134
00:54:09.046 --> 00:54:10.781
- You should come and take a look...
- I can't go.

1135
00:54:11.318 --> 00:54:12.199
(Juyeon) Yes?

1136
00:54:12.767 --> 00:54:15.600
I said something rude
It seems like he's trying to stop me and kill me.

1137
00:54:15.667 --> 00:54:17.220
Because I won't go any further.

1138
00:54:17.287 --> 00:54:19.356
Whether you get it from someone else or do it yourself.

1139
00:54:19.423 --> 00:54:21.091
Please tell me to take care of it.

1140
00:54:22.663 --> 00:54:24.595
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1141
00:54:28.869 --> 00:54:30.067
(Nanjing) I can’t do any more

1142
00:54:30.868 --> 00:54:32.005
I can't, I can't

1143
00:54:45.419 --> 00:54:46.333
Hello?

1144
00:54:46.400 --> 00:54:47.701
(Article 1) Oh, yes, hello?

1145
00:54:47.768 --> 00:54:48.855
Where should we go?

1146
00:54:48.922 --> 00:54:50.066
Myeongjin Officetel

1147
00:54:50.133 --> 00:54:52.222
No, it's a bathroom.

1148
00:54:52.289 --> 00:54:53.460
no

1149
00:54:53.527 --> 00:54:55.552
Department store, please go to the nearest department store

1150
00:54:56.096 --> 00:54:57.461
Ah, yes, I understand.

1151
00:55:03.634 --> 00:55:05.338
Sir, please increase the audio.

1152
00:55:05.405 --> 00:55:06.407
(Article 1) Yes

1153
00:55:09.610 --> 00:55:12.033
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST-Continued]

1154
00:55:21.451 --> 00:55:22.486
[Nankyung’s sobbing sound]

1155
00:55:26.159 --> 00:55:27.758
[cell phone vibrating sound]

1156
00:55:45.412 --> 00:55:46.584
[cell phone vibrating sound]

1157
00:56:00.668 --> 00:56:01.734
Sir

1158
00:56:01.801 --> 00:56:03.327
Please return the car, quickly!

1159
00:56:07.601 --> 00:56:09.099
[Doppler operation sound]

1160
00:56:13.667 --> 00:56:15.005
[Heavy breathing]

1161
00:56:16.343 --> 00:56:19.343
I feel like my stomach is a little tight.

1162
00:56:21.135 --> 00:56:22.634
(Lee Young) That can’t be possible?

1163
00:56:22.701 --> 00:56:23.634
(Swimming) Isn’t it?

1164
00:56:23.701 --> 00:56:25.382
Write, but

1165
00:56:25.868 --> 00:56:29.052
It seems a little different from when I started.
It'll be okay, teacher?

1166
00:56:31.503 --> 00:56:32.956
(Lee Young) Which one are you more uncomfortable with?

1167
00:56:33.023 --> 00:56:35.025
(Sooyoung) Write, uh...

1168
00:56:35.929 --> 00:56:38.061
I think the left side is a bit lumpy.
[dark music]

1169
00:56:40.267 --> 00:56:41.298
Wait a minute

1170
00:56:46.507 --> 00:56:48.534
[Call connection tone]

1171
00:56:48.601 --> 00:56:50.307
- (Dowon) Hello?
- (Lee Young) Ah, teacher

1172
00:56:50.374 --> 00:56:52.767
We have to go for another 30 minutes.

1173
00:56:52.834 --> 00:56:54.912
The mother suddenly
You said you had a knot in your stomach.

1174
00:56:56.049 --> 00:56:57.714
How much does it hurt for the mother?

1175
00:56:57.781 --> 00:56:59.082
Do you feel like you need to poop?

1176
00:56:59.850 --> 00:57:01.567
(Lee Young) You don’t feel like that, do you?

1177
00:57:01.634 --> 00:57:02.422
(Swimming) Ah...

1178
00:57:02.489 --> 00:57:04.855
Write, ah, I don’t think so.

1179
00:57:06.059 --> 00:57:08.601
Well, it doesn't hurt very much.

1180
00:57:08.668 --> 00:57:10.235
You don’t even feel like you need to poop.

1181
00:57:10.302 --> 00:57:11.395
Is something like amniotic fluid flowing?

1182
00:57:12.302 --> 00:57:13.664
No, there isn't

1183
00:57:14.168 --> 00:57:16.001
(Dowon) It’s not that urgent.

1184
00:57:16.068 --> 00:57:18.101
Continuously check the baby's heart rate with Doppler.

1185
00:57:18.168 --> 00:57:20.400
Uterine contractions are okay with the manual, but watch carefully.

1186
00:57:20.467 --> 00:57:21.872
We reassure the mother

1187
00:57:22.376 --> 00:57:23.480
yes, i understand

1188
00:57:24.935 --> 00:57:25.777
[Call end sound]

1189
00:57:25.844 --> 00:57:27.444
[Sooyoung moans in pain]

1190
00:57:28.649 --> 00:57:29.681
[Sooyoung exhales]

1191
00:57:30.884 --> 00:57:32.316
[Doppler operation sound]

1192
00:57:33.921 --> 00:57:35.638
Driver, please hurry up a bit.

1193
00:57:38.067 --> 00:57:40.067
[heavy music]

1194
00:57:44.097 --> 00:57:46.263
- (Guidance voice) Because the customer is on the phone...
- (Nankyung) Who are you talking to right now?

1195
00:57:46.330 --> 00:57:47.534
[Press the elevator button repeatedly]

1196
00:57:49.469 --> 00:57:50.400
[Call end sound]

1197
00:57:50.935 --> 00:57:53.062
(Juyeon) I didn’t answer the phone so I left a message.

1198
00:57:53.129 --> 00:57:55.333
Please clean up line 1011.

1199
00:57:55.400 --> 00:57:57.808
Room 1011 is a patient suffering from miso?

1200
00:57:58.768 --> 00:58:00.444
Why are you suddenly organizing the lines?

1201
00:58:04.117 --> 00:58:05.849
[Nankyung’s heavy breathing]

1202
00:58:29.069 --> 00:58:30.274
(Juyeon) Where did you go?

1203
00:58:31.044 --> 00:58:33.543
Teacher Dowon organized the line.
He did it and left.

1204
00:58:34.515 --> 00:58:36.847
(Nankyung) Why suddenly...

1205
00:58:45.885 --> 00:58:47.801
[Guardian's crying sound]

1206
00:58:50.931 --> 00:58:52.095
[Nanjing’s sigh]

1207
00:58:53.634 --> 00:58:54.467
teacher

1208
00:58:55.565 --> 00:58:57.134
I'll just do that dressing once.

1209
00:58:57.634 --> 00:58:58.472
Yes?

1210
00:58:58.539 --> 00:58:59.875
(Nanjing) I couldn’t do it yesterday either.

1211
00:59:00.701 --> 00:59:02.506
I could only do it once today.

1212
00:59:04.000 --> 00:59:06.309
So I'll just do it one last time

1213
00:59:06.376 --> 00:59:07.848
(Smile) Then, go ahead.

1214
00:59:07.915 --> 00:59:09.212
But did you wash your hands?

1215
00:59:11.168 --> 00:59:12.434
(Namkyung) Then, wash your hands first...

1216
00:59:12.501 --> 00:59:13.483
[Nanjing’s surprised exclamation]

1217
00:59:15.268 --> 00:59:16.186
What is it?

1218
00:59:17.391 --> 00:59:18.812
To get my glasses

1219
00:59:20.401 --> 00:59:23.434
(Smile) But what if I’m an hour late?

1220
00:59:23.501 --> 00:59:26.300
It's oozing and my heart feels weird.

1221
00:59:26.367 --> 00:59:29.166
Where have you been, you were surprised!

1222
00:59:30.167 --> 00:59:33.603
I moved because the window next door was wider.

1223
00:59:35.035 --> 00:59:36.173
[Sigh of relief]

1224
00:59:39.001 --> 00:59:40.277
Well done

1225
00:59:40.868 --> 00:59:41.812
[Weeping moans]

1226
00:59:44.147 --> 00:59:46.950
[Nankyung’s sobbing sound]

1227
00:59:50.302 --> 00:59:52.022
It disappears after you control it.

1228
00:59:52.534 --> 00:59:53.400
[sniffling sound]

1229
00:59:53.467 --> 00:59:55.425
Something got in my eye

1230
00:59:56.897 --> 00:59:58.934
(Namkyung) But how do you know about Conta?

1231
00:59:59.001 --> 01:00:01.131
Even a Seodang dog knows that much in 3 years.

1232
01:00:03.168 --> 01:00:04.704
don't worry

1233
01:00:04.771 --> 01:00:07.471
I washed my hands twice today
The gloves are new too.

1234
01:00:12.892 --> 01:00:13.744
[sniffling sound]

1235
01:00:18.051 --> 01:00:19.382
Are you scolded because of me?

1236
01:00:20.517 --> 01:00:23.286
Or is it because you're having a hard time because of me?

1237
01:00:24.035 --> 01:00:25.055
It's not

1238
01:00:26.734 --> 01:00:28.625
It's because of me

1239
01:00:29.601 --> 01:00:32.395
I'm sorry if I bothered you.

1240
01:00:37.968 --> 01:00:39.636
Sorry to bother you

1241
01:00:42.935 --> 01:00:43.874
No

1242
01:00:47.501 --> 01:00:50.441
(Smile) That place disinfects well.
The professor said that

1243
01:00:52.886 --> 01:00:56.286
I’m also rubbing this medicine.
I know it's not a big deal

1244
01:00:57.235 --> 01:01:00.333
Receive it from someone who is good at it
I wonder if anything would be better

1245
01:01:00.400 --> 01:01:02.400
[Calm music]

1246
01:01:06.033 --> 01:01:07.629
It's been about 3 years

1247
01:01:08.501 --> 01:01:10.267
That's how people become

1248
01:01:11.405 --> 01:01:12.907
I know you're having a hard time

1249
01:01:14.107 --> 01:01:15.010
I

1250
01:01:17.811 --> 01:01:19.376
All I can think about is myself

1251
01:01:22.302 --> 01:01:23.280
I'm sorry

1252
01:01:24.915 --> 01:01:27.921
No, the dressing is important.

1253
01:01:27.988 --> 01:01:29.686
This isn't a big deal.

1254
01:01:30.768 --> 01:01:34.791
(Nanjing) If you disinfect well, the wound will heal quickly.
Discharge is also faster.

1255
01:01:34.858 --> 01:01:36.701
And I'm really good at it

1256
01:01:36.768 --> 01:01:39.662
I'm the best among our first-year students.

1257
01:01:39.729 --> 01:01:40.897
[light laughter]

1258
01:01:41.498 --> 01:01:42.833
Then will you come again tomorrow?

1259
01:01:45.234 --> 01:01:47.299
(Nanjing) Ojo, number 4

1260
01:01:47.366 --> 01:01:48.363
tomorrow is morning

1261
01:01:49.710 --> 01:01:52.042
I only come once in the morning, to straighten my nose

1262
01:01:54.147 --> 01:01:55.078
Are you discharged?

1263
01:01:56.513 --> 01:01:59.708
Oh, look, I was discharged sooner.

1264
01:01:59.775 --> 01:02:00.758
[sniffling sound]

1265
01:02:02.033 --> 01:02:04.534
(Smile) I guess you’re happy that I’m leaving.

1266
01:02:04.601 --> 01:02:06.326
Oh no, no, no

1267
01:02:06.393 --> 01:02:07.889
No, no?

1268
01:02:08.528 --> 01:02:11.394
Being discharged is the best thing.
[Nankyung’s sobbing sound]

1269
01:02:11.868 --> 01:02:15.135
(Namkyung) I’m really good at picking out the lines of my nose.

1270
01:02:15.202 --> 01:02:16.366
[Smile chuckles]

1271
01:02:20.440 --> 01:02:22.072
[Nanjing’s laughter]

1272
01:02:42.168 --> 01:02:43.460
(Article 2) Are you okay?

1273
01:02:46.266 --> 01:02:47.195
[Sigh of relief]

1274
01:02:49.534 --> 01:02:50.534
[light sigh]

1275
01:03:07.000 --> 01:03:09.085
- (Minha) Teacher Oh I-young?
- (Lee Young) Yes

1276
01:03:09.623 --> 01:03:12.055
[Minha’s light smile]
(Lee Young) Ah, hello

1277
01:03:13.160 --> 01:03:14.791
You are teacher Yulje from Jongno, right?

1278
01:03:16.192 --> 01:03:17.731
Are you there yet?

1279
01:03:17.798 --> 01:03:19.729
I was wondering if the mother was okay.

1280
01:03:21.235 --> 01:03:22.569
(Lee Young) Ah, let’s go

1281
01:03:22.636 --> 01:03:25.104
He kept saying it felt like he had a lump in his stomach.

1282
01:03:25.171 --> 01:03:26.400
I said it was okay again

1283
01:03:26.467 --> 01:03:28.742
I asked him to go quickly because he was sick.

1284
01:03:28.809 --> 01:03:31.678
Oh, the doctor at our hospital said it's okay.

1285
01:03:31.745 --> 01:03:32.946
[light laughter]

1286
01:03:33.013 --> 01:03:34.711
- Teacher Gu Do-won?
- (Lee Young) Yes

1287
01:03:35.682 --> 01:03:38.582
But it's been a year and this is my first time doing something like this.

1288
01:03:39.520 --> 01:03:41.585
I'm worried because I don't know him well.

1289
01:03:42.356 --> 01:03:43.523
(Minha) Mother

1290
01:03:43.590 --> 01:03:46.829
uterine contraction inhibitor
I think he got sick because he didn't go in well.

1291
01:03:46.896 --> 01:03:47.727
(Lee Young) Ah...

1292
01:03:47.794 --> 01:03:49.296
(Minha) Are you okay now?

1293
01:03:49.363 --> 01:03:50.427
It's really okay

1294
01:03:51.064 --> 01:03:52.195
[Sigh of relief]

1295
01:03:53.066 --> 01:03:54.097
Are you very surprised?

1296
01:03:54.868 --> 01:03:55.832
yes

1297
01:03:56.436 --> 01:03:58.638
If 4 years is okay,

1298
01:03:58.705 --> 01:04:00.500
It's really okay

1299
01:04:00.567 --> 01:04:02.038
And what if it's not okay?

1300
01:04:02.509 --> 01:04:03.945
It's the teacher's fault, right?

1301
01:04:05.979 --> 01:04:08.482
(Minha) Good things about first year
That's just one thing

1302
01:04:08.549 --> 01:04:10.317
If anything goes wrong, it’s the senior’s fault

1303
01:04:10.384 --> 01:04:11.948
Otherwise, is it the fault of the person who ordered it?

1304
01:04:13.547 --> 01:04:14.588
That's right

1305
01:04:14.655 --> 01:04:16.286
It's all Gudowon's fault.

1306
01:04:17.958 --> 01:04:20.323
(Lee Young) But even if it’s not my fault

1307
01:04:21.028 --> 01:04:23.159
If something wrong happens to the mother

1308
01:04:23.931 --> 01:04:26.563
I think it will be something I will never forget for the rest of my life.

1309
01:04:28.969 --> 01:04:30.971
I'll go then

1310
01:04:31.038 --> 01:04:31.901
(Minha) Hmm

1311
01:04:34.195 --> 01:04:35.639
Wait a minute, teacher.

1312
01:04:36.777 --> 01:04:37.741
Uh...

1313
01:04:38.679 --> 01:04:39.943
Would you like to go have a cup of coffee?

1314
01:04:41.433 --> 01:04:42.400
yes?

1315
01:04:42.467 --> 01:04:43.880
(Minha) Huh?
[train horn sound effect]

1316
01:04:44.673 --> 01:04:45.649
(Lee Young) Uh...

1317
01:04:48.355 --> 01:04:50.086
[Sound of approaching footsteps]

1318
01:04:51.425 --> 01:04:54.858
(Minha) I saw the transfer coming.
I think it’s been a great first year.

1319
01:04:55.762 --> 01:04:56.663
(Lee Young) Thank you

1320
01:04:56.730 --> 01:04:58.895
(Minha) Teachers from higher years
It’s so pretty, right?

1321
01:05:00.067 --> 01:05:01.201
(Lee Young) Not at all

1322
01:05:01.268 --> 01:05:04.167
(Minha) A
Then the seniority difference is strange.

1323
01:05:04.234 --> 01:05:05.300
Write...

1324
01:05:05.367 --> 01:05:08.538
I barely even got a residency.

1325
01:05:09.467 --> 01:05:12.008
I only remember being scolded for three months in the first year.

1326
01:05:12.513 --> 01:05:14.981
Everyone screamed like that when they saw me.

1327
01:05:15.048 --> 01:05:17.533
No, it's your first time, so it's natural that you don't know, right?

1328
01:05:17.600 --> 01:05:19.582
Why was everyone like that? It was so unfair.

1329
01:05:20.617 --> 01:05:21.551
[light laughter]

1330
01:05:22.089 --> 01:05:23.457
I only found out today

1331
01:05:23.524 --> 01:05:25.021
why am i so upset

1332
01:05:27.728 --> 01:05:29.626
It was just a robot

1333
01:05:31.298 --> 01:05:35.832
If you want to come, come, if you want to go, go, if you want to do it, do it.

1334
01:05:37.104 --> 01:05:40.904
Concerns or sincerity about the mother
There wasn't even one

1335
01:05:42.109 --> 01:05:43.844
You can't learn that

1336
01:05:43.911 --> 01:05:45.975
They said they would teach me
It's not like you can know

1337
01:05:46.513 --> 01:05:47.857
So of course I didn't know

1338
01:05:51.634 --> 01:05:53.587
But our first-year teacher

1339
01:05:53.654 --> 01:05:54.885
You already know that, right?

1340
01:05:57.434 --> 01:05:59.556
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1341
01:06:00.494 --> 01:06:02.262
Let's leave before it gets stuck

1342
01:06:02.329 --> 01:06:03.560
Now, this

1343
01:06:06.534 --> 01:06:08.401
(Lee Young) What is this?

1344
01:06:08.468 --> 01:06:10.103
You can give it to Mr. Gu Do-won.

1345
01:06:10.170 --> 01:06:11.601
Please make sure to tell me within today

1346
01:06:12.339 --> 01:06:13.536
[Embarrassed sigh]

1347
01:06:17.917 --> 01:06:18.879
yes

1348
01:06:18.946 --> 01:06:22.245
(Minha) It’s important for the mother.
Please hurry up, okay?

1349
01:06:22.950 --> 01:06:23.880
huh?

1350
01:06:26.887 --> 01:06:27.918
yes
[Minha’s light smile]

1351
01:06:27.985 --> 01:06:29.101
thank you
[cell phone ringing sound]

1352
01:06:29.168 --> 01:06:30.286
Oh, wait a minute.

1353
01:06:31.792 --> 01:06:32.856
[Minha’s surprised gasp]

1354
01:06:33.627 --> 01:06:35.495
Uh, honey

1355
01:06:35.562 --> 01:06:36.559
(Minha) Yes

1356
01:06:37.345 --> 01:06:38.532
Kalguksu?

1357
01:06:38.599 --> 01:06:40.233
Ah, good

1358
01:06:40.300 --> 01:06:42.836
Oh, then add me some extras.

1359
01:06:42.903 --> 01:06:43.904
Yeah

1360
01:06:43.971 --> 01:06:45.568
[Happy laughter]

1361
01:06:48.045 --> 01:06:52.012
Okay, I love you more, yeah

1362
01:06:52.079 --> 01:06:53.977
Yeah, okay, yeah

1363
01:06:54.681 --> 01:06:55.917
[Call end sound]

1364
01:06:58.585 --> 01:07:01.107
Yes, newlyweds
[light laughter]

1365
01:07:01.174 --> 01:07:02.118
(Lee Young) Ah

1366
01:07:02.753 --> 01:07:03.820
[Minha’s shy laugh]

1367
01:07:04.291 --> 01:07:06.089
Well then, goodbye teacher Oh I-young.

1368
01:07:07.160 --> 01:07:09.333
- thank you
- (Minha) Hey, what is gratitude?

1369
01:07:09.400 --> 01:07:10.326
[Minha’s light laughter]

1370
01:07:11.832 --> 01:07:13.430
I did really well today

1371
01:07:14.001 --> 01:07:15.850
We'll definitely see you again

1372
01:07:24.474 --> 01:07:25.675
(Lee Young) IC

1373
01:07:48.302 --> 01:07:49.302
hello

1374
01:07:49.369 --> 01:07:50.600
Let's talk

1375
01:07:51.111 --> 01:07:52.026
yes

1376
01:07:55.534 --> 01:07:56.973
(Jeongmin) I watched

1377
01:07:57.511 --> 01:07:58.445
(Sabi) Yes?

1378
01:07:58.512 --> 01:08:01.366
Cheon Eun-pyo, mother at MFICU

1379
01:08:01.433 --> 01:08:02.612
Ah, yes

1380
01:08:03.333 --> 01:08:04.417
sorry

1381
01:08:04.484 --> 01:08:05.682
It's nothing to be sorry about

1382
01:08:07.754 --> 01:08:09.118
(Jeongmin) Don’t say you can’t do it.

1383
01:08:12.333 --> 01:08:13.857
Why not try something else instead?

1384
01:08:15.462 --> 01:08:16.326
yes?

1385
01:08:18.038 --> 01:08:19.166
(Jae-il) I will work hard!

1386
01:08:19.233 --> 01:08:20.897
[Snoring sound is heard]

1387
01:08:21.869 --> 01:08:22.866
[Jaeil’s surprised gasp]

1388
01:08:26.600 --> 01:08:27.737
[Jaeil’s sigh]

1389
01:08:30.177 --> 01:08:31.344
[Sound of head hitting]

1390
01:08:31.411 --> 01:08:32.775
[Jaeil groans in pain]

1391
01:08:32.842 --> 01:08:34.444
[Snoring sound is heard]

1392
01:08:38.252 --> 01:08:39.816
[Sabi’s snoring sound]

1393
01:08:49.930 --> 01:08:50.927
Hey there

1394
01:08:55.369 --> 01:08:56.633
(Eunpyo) Teacher

1395
01:09:00.143 --> 01:09:02.672
It's so noisy that I can't sleep.

1396
01:09:03.243 --> 01:09:04.274
sorry

1397
01:09:04.824 --> 01:09:07.410
Oh, it's not like I'm protesting, really.

1398
01:09:08.882 --> 01:09:11.318
I'll count it as an apology

1399
01:09:11.385 --> 01:09:12.352
Go

1400
01:09:12.419 --> 01:09:13.550
Hey, that's it.

1401
01:09:14.521 --> 01:09:17.053
It's not an apology, I'm worried.

1402
01:09:18.559 --> 01:09:19.526
What?

1403
01:09:19.593 --> 01:09:21.761
(Safety) Except what Professor Seo Jeong-min can’t do.

1404
01:09:21.828 --> 01:09:23.927
He told me to help by doing what I'm good at.

1405
01:09:25.065 --> 01:09:27.534
I analyzed the birth chart.

1406
01:09:27.601 --> 01:09:30.670
Since the day before yesterday, my blood pressure baseline has been
It seems to be rising little by little

1407
01:09:30.737 --> 01:09:34.203
In the morning, my blood pressure was 90 out of 150 for a while.
You also had a headache

1408
01:09:34.975 --> 01:09:37.140
In my judgment

1409
01:09:38.433 --> 01:09:40.914
I was wondering if I was getting pre-eclampsia.

1410
01:09:40.981 --> 01:09:41.967
Yes?

1411
01:09:42.034 --> 01:09:44.080
(Sabi) These are convulsions and seizures
I can come

1412
01:09:45.234 --> 01:09:46.215
(Eunpyo) No...

1413
01:09:46.820 --> 01:09:49.919
If you're that worried, do it in the morning. In the morning.

1414
01:09:49.986 --> 01:09:52.433
You can check it in the morning.

1415
01:09:52.500 --> 01:09:53.751
no

1416
01:09:53.818 --> 01:09:57.197
The blood test results will come out soon.

1417
01:09:57.264 --> 01:09:59.953
(Sabi) I was only planning to go after seeing the blood test results.

1418
01:10:00.020 --> 01:10:02.502
I usually don't sleep

1419
01:10:02.569 --> 01:10:04.104
I just found out that you snore again

1420
01:10:04.171 --> 01:10:06.603
(Eunpyo) Oh, that’s it, it’s over.

1421
01:10:15.087 --> 01:10:16.683
[Thump sound]

1422
01:10:16.750 --> 01:10:18.033
(Mother) Uh, teacher, here!

1423
01:10:18.100 --> 01:10:19.786
[nervous music]

1424
01:10:19.853 --> 01:10:21.721
(Sabi) Teacher Eunpyo Cheon’s mother collapsed!

1425
01:10:21.788 --> 01:10:24.087
Quick, please attach a monitor quickly, quickly!

1426
01:10:25.092 --> 01:10:26.756
Wait a minute, get out of the way!

1427
01:10:50.113 --> 01:10:51.251
(Lee Young) Teacher, this

1428
01:10:51.318 --> 01:10:52.415
(Dowon) Oh, are you here?

1429
01:10:53.387 --> 01:10:55.856
(Lee Young) Songdo Yulje Fellow
I told you to give it to me

1430
01:10:55.923 --> 01:10:58.187
It's important
He told me to deliver it quickly.

1431
01:10:59.237 --> 01:11:01.290
Oh, be sure to call to confirm when you receive it.

1432
01:11:02.596 --> 01:11:03.626
(Dowon) Oh, yeah

1433
01:11:14.107 --> 01:11:16.300
Oh, that's right, I almost forgot.

1434
01:11:17.206 --> 01:11:18.044
thank you

1435
01:11:18.111 --> 01:11:20.347
(Lee Young) No, then

1436
01:11:20.414 --> 01:11:23.827
(Do-won) Dr. Oh I-young, do you want to go see the surgery?
You haven't seen your twin yet.

1437
01:11:23.894 --> 01:11:24.867
(Lee Young) Uh...

1438
01:11:24.934 --> 01:11:26.215
[Sound of door opening]

1439
01:11:32.479 --> 01:11:33.389
no

1440
01:11:34.494 --> 01:11:35.625
Let's go

1441
01:11:36.430 --> 01:11:37.960
(Dowon) Okay, go, then

1442
01:11:38.832 --> 01:11:40.266
- Are you ready?
- (together) yes

1443
01:11:40.333 --> 01:11:41.767
- (Do-won) Please bring the mother with me.
- (Re-elected) Yes

1444
01:11:41.834 --> 01:11:43.399
[Sound of door opening]

1445
01:11:47.941 --> 01:11:49.105
(Sora) Teacher Oh I-young

1446
01:11:52.079 --> 01:11:54.948
- (Lee Young) Hello
- (Sora) Because of you, our teacher Joo Sang-hyeon

1447
01:11:55.015 --> 01:11:56.979
Do you know that the professor scolded me so much?

1448
01:11:58.452 --> 01:11:59.849
(Lee Young) Yes?
[Sora's sigh]

1449
01:12:04.681 --> 01:12:05.855
(Sora) What is General?

1450
01:12:07.327 --> 01:12:08.491
What is a general?

1451
01:12:12.499 --> 01:12:13.400
(Lee Young) General anesthesia...

1452
01:12:13.467 --> 01:12:16.144
(Sora) At General
Full body and lower body anesthesia

1453
01:12:16.734 --> 01:12:17.834
You know there are two, right?

1454
01:12:18.839 --> 01:12:21.404
But if you just call it general

1455
01:12:22.642 --> 01:12:25.333
Is it the whole body or the lower body?
How do we know?

1456
01:12:25.400 --> 01:12:26.852
[dark music]

1457
01:12:26.919 --> 01:12:29.712
You have to do the notification correctly.

1458
01:12:30.500 --> 01:12:32.215
This is basic, basic!

1459
01:12:34.454 --> 01:12:36.097
(Lee Young) So far, the lower body

1460
01:12:36.164 --> 01:12:39.021
Don't say general
Notified with Spinal

1461
01:12:39.493 --> 01:12:41.791
It has been said that only general anesthesia is general.

1462
01:12:42.333 --> 01:12:43.797
So I did that too

1463
01:12:43.864 --> 01:12:45.065
(Sora) Is it our mistake?

1464
01:12:45.132 --> 01:12:46.195
[Sora's snort]

1465
01:12:47.234 --> 01:12:49.632
Then what did Noti say then?
Say the same thing

1466
01:12:51.038 --> 01:12:53.202
Try again? Let's take a look

1467
01:12:53.269 --> 01:12:54.103
(Sanghyun) Teacher

1468
01:12:54.170 --> 01:12:55.776
- At that time, I...
- (Sora) No

1469
01:12:55.843 --> 01:12:57.974
Don’t remember how you did Noti?

1470
01:12:58.812 --> 01:13:00.510
Try again, let me hear it

1471
01:13:02.716 --> 01:13:04.413
[Sound of door opening]

1472
01:13:05.228 --> 01:13:06.382
(Dowon) Try it, Notty.

1473
01:13:12.404 --> 01:13:13.389
You want to try it?

1474
01:13:16.864 --> 01:13:18.561
Try notifying it the same way as before.

1475
01:13:22.202 --> 01:13:23.199
[Lee Young sighs]

1476
01:13:27.274 --> 01:13:28.404
(Lee Young) Mother Rose Hwa

1477
01:13:29.176 --> 01:13:30.777
Baby's heart rate is not good

1478
01:13:30.844 --> 01:13:32.308
General please

1479
01:13:32.813 --> 01:13:33.910
[Sora's snort]

1480
01:13:35.749 --> 01:13:37.380
(Dowon) It’s the same, like the note I did today?

1481
01:13:39.534 --> 01:13:41.450
What's wrong with me?
I don't know, sir.

1482
01:13:42.489 --> 01:13:43.452
(Sora) Yes?

1483
01:13:46.260 --> 01:13:47.216
Then...

1484
01:13:47.961 --> 01:13:49.559
Why is the preparation wrong?

1485
01:13:50.230 --> 01:13:52.627
(Dowon) The current Noti method is
If you are uncomfortable

1486
01:13:52.694 --> 01:13:55.298
That's with our professors
I think we need to talk.

1487
01:13:56.300 --> 01:13:59.335
It's a word we've all used together like that.
It's not a problem we can solve.

1488
01:14:00.001 --> 01:14:00.970
(Sora) No, well...

1489
01:14:03.500 --> 01:14:04.740
I don't want to change it

1490
01:14:07.101 --> 01:14:10.032
No, if only this teacher joins in.
Because things keep going wrong

1491
01:14:10.967 --> 01:14:12.482
It's just for confirmation, or something like that.

1492
01:14:13.320 --> 01:14:14.417
Something happened last time too

1493
01:14:14.922 --> 01:14:16.998
(Dowon) What happened last time?
What kind of thing are you talking about?

1494
01:14:18.126 --> 01:14:19.727
(Sora) I heard it from Sanghyun.

1495
01:14:19.794 --> 01:14:21.094
Teacher Oh I-young

1496
01:14:21.161 --> 01:14:23.163
I'm going to have a section on my mother's night

1497
01:14:23.230 --> 01:14:25.695
You lied and said it was an emergency and got off?

1498
01:14:26.233 --> 01:14:27.263
Does that make sense?

1499
01:14:28.367 --> 01:14:29.403
(Sanghyun) Teacher, what about that?

1500
01:14:29.470 --> 01:14:30.400
(Dowon) No.

1501
01:14:31.005 --> 01:14:32.966
The result may have been that way

1502
01:14:33.033 --> 01:14:35.900
Teacher Oh I-young lied
I wouldn't have left the operating room.

1503
01:14:35.967 --> 01:14:38.635
[Calm music]
Our first year students don't work like that.

1504
01:14:39.446 --> 01:14:42.345
I didn't teach you that
It's never happened before

1505
01:14:43.116 --> 01:14:45.514
Teacher Myeong-won here will also know this.

1506
01:14:48.522 --> 01:14:49.476
(Eunwon) Huh?

1507
01:14:50.091 --> 01:14:53.760
Um, I was going to talk about it already.

1508
01:14:53.827 --> 01:14:56.192
Something must have gone wrong back then.

1509
01:14:57.665 --> 01:14:58.832
sorry

1510
01:14:58.899 --> 01:15:01.368
Well, I think everyone is ready.

1511
01:15:01.435 --> 01:15:02.865
I have to scrub and come back.

1512
01:15:07.241 --> 01:15:09.176
[Sound of door opening]

1513
01:15:11.745 --> 01:15:12.808
(Sora) What was there?

1514
01:15:13.542 --> 01:15:14.500
(Sanghyun) That’s...

1515
01:15:14.567 --> 01:15:15.382
[Sound of door closing]

1516
01:15:15.449 --> 01:15:17.313
Teacher Eom Jae-il told me

1517
01:15:18.385 --> 01:15:21.354
With teacher Eom Jae-il
When I was with Teacher Oh I-young

1518
